**UNDERWRITING AGREEMENT**

THIS UNDERWRITING AGREEMENT is made and entered into as of the date hereof, by and among Harper & Associates, a company incorporated in the USA, with its principal place of business located in the USA, the issuer (the "Issuer"), and Alberto Almeida, with an account number C98367523 and a swift bic ABCDUS33, the underwriter (the "Underwriter").

WHEREAS, the Issuer desires to issue and sell an aggregate of $50,000,000 principal amount of its Securities (the "Securities") pursuant to a Prospectus, dated as of the date hereof (the "Prospectus");

WHEREAS, the Underwriter desires to purchase from the Issuer, and the Issuer desires to sell to the Underwriter, the Securities as set forth in this Agreement;

NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the mutual covenants contained herein and for other good and valuable consideration, the receipt and sufficiency of which is hereby acknowledged, the parties hereto agree as follows:

1. **Purchase and Sale of Securities.** The Issuer agrees to sell to the Underwriter, and the Underwriter agrees to purchase from the Issuer, $50,000,000 principal amount of the Securities, at a purchase price of 100% of the principal amount thereof, less the underwriting discount.

2. **Closing.** The closing of the purchase and sale of the Securities shall take place at the offices of Harper & Associates, on a date to be determined (the "Closing Date"), but in no event later than 30 days from the date hereof, at 10:00 a.m., local time (the "Closing Time"), or at such other time as the Issuer and the Underwriter may agree upon in writing.

4. **Representations and Warranties of the Issuer.** The Issuer represents and warrants to the Underwriter that:

(a) The Issuer has been duly organized and is validly existing as a corporation in good standing under the laws of the USA;

(b) The Issuer has the corporate power and authority to enter into this Agreement, to issue and sell the Securities, and to perform its obligations hereunder;

(c) Alberto Almeida, with a social security number 530-14-9554, and email albertoalmeida@hotmail.com, is the authorized signatory for the Issuer.

5. **Conditions to Closing.** The obligations of the Underwriter hereunder are subject to the fulfillment, on or before the Closing Date, of each of the following conditions:

(a) The Issuer shall have performed all of its obligations hereunder and under the other Transaction Documents;

(b) No material adverse change shall have occurred in the business, financial condition, or results of operations of the Issuer since the date hereof;

(c) The Underwriter shall have received an opinion of counsel to the Issuer, dated as of the Closing Date, to the effect that the Issuer has been duly organized and is validly existing as a corporation in good standing under the laws of the USA.
